WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.880
The hands that shaped the heavens

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.440
And scattered every star
Reached into this broken world

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.780
And met us where we are
They touched the ones forgotten

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.920
The ones no one would see
The hands that made creation

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:31.140
Reached down and made them clean
Power enough to form the world

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:37.320
Tender enough to touch
The hands that held the nails

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.740
Are the hands that hold me now
The hands that bore the scars

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:46.120
Will never let me down
The hands that healed the broken

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:53.060
Still reach for me somehow
The hands that held the nails

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:59.060
Are the hands that hold me now

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.600
They took a child by the hand
And called her back to life

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:18.960
They broke the bread for thousands
They served throughout the night

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.840
They washed the feet of sinners
Though heaven shouts His name

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:28.660
The hands that ruled creation
Chose a towel over fame

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:37.460
Strong enough to conquer death
Humble enough to serve

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:41.460
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.840
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:50.220
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:58.220
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:16.540
The hands that blessed the broken
Were wounded for my sin

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:21.000
The hands that gave out mercy
Were opened once again

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.360
And when the grave stood empty
The scars still told the story

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.500
The hands that death could not hold down
Were lifted up in glory

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:38.720
The wounds were still upon His hands
But death had lost its claim

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:43.120
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:47.540
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.940
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:02:51.940 --> 00:03:00.740
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:08.660
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:17.140
When I am afraid
You hold me

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:21.520
When I lose my way
You guide me

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:26.220
When I cannot stand
You carry me

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:31.060
No one can take me
From Your hand

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.380
You hold me
You keep me

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.000
Scarred hands
Still reaching

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:42.360
Grace and mercy
still revealing

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.700
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.080
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:55.440
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:03:55.440 --> 00:04:04.180
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:11.800
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:19.620
The hands that shaped the heavens

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:24.100
The hands that raised the dead
They washed the feet of men;

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:28.560
Were wounded in my stead
And nothing in creation

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:32.880
Can take me from them now
The hands that held the nails

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:39.980
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:47.870
The hands that held the nails
Still hold me now
